  "description": "evidence/g15_m_a_dual_end_quality_reharvest_<UTC>.json。G15.2 P0 硬门 M-a（g15.p0.m_a.dual_end_quality_reharvest，步骤 269；G15_CONTRACT §4.2 M-a/G-G15-3；G15_ACCEPTANCE_MAP §1 M-a 行；G14PLUS_RECORD §6.3 G15 承接锚兑现面）：上游三门（G13 M-c ue_upscale_parity + G13 M-d ue_lumen_gi_parity + G12 M163 ue_pt_parity）同口径复跑 fresh evidence（timestamp ≥ 本波启动锚）全 PASS 只读核验 + 三 parity 契约与三冻结登记表 0-byte git 机核 + 20 行登记表逐项重评（gap_id 逐字转引 + fresh measured_delta f64 精确可溯源 + 方向判定 converged/maintained/degraded 交叉核验）+ G15 差距处置表 milestones/g15/g15_quality_gap_disposition.json 落盘零空行（gaplib 正典形同族 schema）+ UE 方差带程序产（跨会话样本级联 ×2.0 与同会话探针带取 max，G14 M-a 双程序产面取严口径继承，fresh 带入 g15_budget 双条目 measured_local）+ AI 读图基线臂（双场景 × 三档 × 三后端 18 格 Rurix 臂收敛帧 PNG 导出 .tmp/g15_m_a_preview/ + 机器结构代理断言〔非全黑/非全白/亮度直方图非退化/无大块纯色斑块乱序〕+ manifest 入 evidence；AI 画面审查逐格记录归 G15_CONTRACT §8.2）+ RED 五臂独立有效（missing-row/gap-id-tamper/direction-lie/stale-evidence/fresh-delta-missing-field）。",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema_version",
    "subject",
    "symbolic_gate_key",
    "matrix_row",
    "milestone",
    "assertion_id",
    "status",
    "wave",
    "numeric_step",
    "source_ref",
    "base_commit",
